"Ops assistant: an AI agent that investigates Kubernetes incidents using read-only tools (pods, events, logs, metrics, recent deploys), explains the likely cause with evidence, and suggests a fix as a pull request. Read-only cluster access, fixes only via reviewed Git PRs, secrets redacted before anything is sent to the AI, every conclusion backed by evidence. Full intent in docs/aidlc/inception/intent.md; reference incident docs/incidents/2026-10-13-bad-image-tag.md. Skip Ideation and start at Inception."
